the cpu voltage regulator that you wanted shorted for
all P75 to P133 cpu's except the P120 - and nothing
to suggest what you should do for faster cpu's.

I have put a P133 in a Venturis 5100 and overclocked it
to 166 with no problems - and a Venturis 5100 is 
essentially what you get if you put a P100 into a
Venturis 590.

