expressed in terms of on-campus activity by Digital). Presumably, his
main concern was a bit of worry about a number of machines he,
personally, is still involved with for research, and what the future
held for that DEC equipment and the OSes.  This is not the level of
person who should have to seek DEC looking for answers, this is the
level of person Digital should be actively dialoging with on a regular
(without being obnoxious, after all the man is *busy*) basis. (Not
that DEC should be ignoring all those other potential customers either).
