> doing a lot better than DEC. Would Altavista become independent?

AltaVista began its life (once it graduated from research project
status) as an wholly-owned independent subsidiary of DEC back in May
1996.

In mid-1997, Digital elected to bring the organization back under the
burgundy umbrella. IPO was cancelled, CEO Ilene Lang resigned since
being just of one of 160 DEC VPs wasn't what she bargained for or agreed
to when she left Lotus to work for DEC.

