Its RS423, not exactly RS232 serial but a differential interface.
Howver, you can wire up a connector to use the signals you
need, though you wont get full modem control. 
The pinout is as follows :

1 DTR
2 TX (+)     
3 TX (-)
4 RX (-)
5 RX (+)
6 DSR 

note the polarity! 



