  Load the latest PALcode for your systems.  PALcode is available via
  the CD-ROM PALcode distribution, and via the DIGITAL Alpha Firmware
  website: http://www.workstation.digital.com/firmware.html -- and
  remember to power-cycle the box after you load the new firmware.

