  to be running at least OpenVMS Alpha V7.1 on the system -- there is
  some latent run-time code for the DE500-BA adapter in that release
  but no bootstrap code; you must be running V7.1-1H1 for formal DE500-BA
  support by OpenVMS, for both bootstrap and run-time support.

